      "   on question: please choose the plot type from the following list: [contour, image of the sky]. What is the plot type of the plot in this figure? Please format the output as a json as {\"plot types\":[]}, where the list holds the plot type of the plot as its only element.  In addition to providing your answer, please provide your reasoning.  Include this as a separate JSON snippet formatted as {\"explanation\":\"\"} and fill in your reasoning as a string.  Your answer should only include the answer JSON and the explanation JSON snippets, no other text.\n",
